# Operator data — never committed. Contains the personal match database and
# every archived screenshot.
data/

# The sample corpus is withheld from the published repository. Every one of
# these screenshots shows other people's gamertags, and they did not agree to
# being published. Keep them locally — the suite asserts against them here and
# skips where they are absent — but they do not go up. See samples/README.md.
samples/*.png
samples/*.expected.json

# The key mapping PLAYER_A..PLAYER_G back to the real gamertags. Publishing
# this would undo the pseudonymization it exists to support.
samples/identities.local.md

